Summary
-------

Tune Out Catalog dedicates this project — its code, its station data, and its
generated artifacts — to the public domain. You can copy, modify, distribute,
and perform the work, even for commercial purposes, all without asking
permission.

The radio-station metadata is sourced from radio-browser.info, whose community
contributes the underlying data under the same CC0-style public domain
dedication.

No warranty is given, express or implied.
